    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Charming three bedroom mid terrace open plan home with a large back garden brimming with refurbishment potential.\n\nThis superb property features a gated driveway leading to an attractive façade. The entrance hall has laminate floors which continue a light filled dual aspect living room, dining area and kitchen. The open plan layout maximises the space and the room boasts a solid fuel fireplace and understairs storage. The eye catching kitchen overlooks the back garden and enjoys plenty of counter & cupboard space. A rear hall leads to a guest w.c. and the amazing mature garden which is approx. twenty two metres in length and the perfect place to relax & entertain. The garden also gives plenty of scope to extend the property. Upstairs consists of three bedrooms with solid wooden floors. The main bedroom is positioned at the front of the home and comes with fitted wardrobes, an ornate fireplace and a wash hand basin. There are two bedrooms to the rear of the property, one has fitted wardrobes while the other could make an ideal home office or family bathroom. The attic is accessed via the landing.\n\nLissadel Drive is ideally located next to Brickfield Park and there are numerous other sporting facilities on your doorstep. The Red Line Luas is a short stroll away providing easy access to the city centre. Drimnagh has numerous shops, cafes, bars & restaurants making it an ideal location.\n\nFeatures:\nYear of construction 1940\nGated driveway\nOpen plan + dual aspect\nSolid fuel fireplace\nRefurbishment potential\nLarge garden\nSought after location\nSolid wooden floors\nMid terrace\nBuilt in storage\n\n"
      },
